# Base URL of the deployed shared-catalog API (see server/README.md).
#
# Safe to ship: it is a public endpoint that grants nothing on its own. The
# database connection string lives ONLY in the server's environment — putting it
# here would bake it into every APK/IPA, where anyone can extract it.
#
# Leave unset to disable catalog sync entirely: the Settings rows are hidden and
# SMS detection falls back to local keywords, exactly as it worked before.
EXPO_PUBLIC_HINTS_API=
